The aggregate command reads explicit standard input.

========== CLI ==========

ledlight aggregate --format json --file - <<'LEDGER'
commodity SEK
  default
  format 1,000.00 SEK
commodity STOCK
  format 1,000 STOCK
account Assets:Stock
account Assets:Cash
P 2024-01-01 STOCK 12 SEK

2024-01-01 Purchase
  Assets:Stock  10 STOCK {10 SEK}
  Assets:Cash  -100 SEK
LEDGER

========== OUTPUT ==========

[
  {
    "account": "Assets:Cash",
    "commodity": "SEK",
    "quantity": "-100"
  },
  {
    "account": "Assets:Stock",
    "commodity": "STOCK",
    "quantity": "10"
  }
]
